      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Three modifiers that move a surface, one branch each. Noise Displace roughens a ball into a rock; Warp pushes the space round a torus by a smooth noise, flowing as the gear turns its Phase; Displace ripples a ball by a wave the gear rolls round it. Try Noise Displace's Octaves and Roughness, Warp's Amount, and Displace's Frequency."
        }
      },
